## Request

Extend the existing executive-directive contract with a concise operator status capsule and
evidence-backed checkbox milestones. Make Codex's portable route support conversational directive
maintenance without exposing subordinate artifact mechanics to the operator. Roll directive and
subordinate outcome state into one human card and place the current position, recommended next
move, reason, operator need, blockers, and completion boundary before raw project accounting.

Preserve `work/100k.md` as a deterministic read-only projection, preserve existing planning order
and outcome authority, and retain compatibility for existing directives. Update local Markdown,
structured dashboard reporting and template rendering, shipped skills and operator documentation,
and focused regression fixtures. Use the DisplayTest failure as the primary human acceptance case.

After local validation, create the scoped candidate commit, deploy to the configured disposable
Linux and Windows Work2 targets, run changed-behavior checks there, register the candidate and open
owner chain, checkpoint the result, and stop before push or production release.

